{"root":"penuh","ipa":"/pəˈnʊh/","core":"形容词。指空间、容器或程度达到极限，没有剩余空间或余地；也指充满某种情感或特质。","pos":["形容词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/pəˈnʊh/","zh":"满的，充满的","phrases":[{"t":"penuh sesak","zh":"拥挤不堪"},{"t":"penuh perhatian","zh":"全神贯注"},{"t":"penuh semangat","zh":"充满活力"}],"examples":[{"t":"Gelas itu penuh dengan air.","zh":"那个杯子装满了水。"},{"t":"Ruangan ini penuh dengan orang.","zh":"这个房间里挤满了人。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"penuh","ipa":"/pəˈnʊh/","zh":"满的","phrase":{"t":"penuh waktu","zh":"全职"},"example":{"t":"Dia bekerja penuh waktu di perusahaan itu.","zh":"他在那家公司全职工作。"}},{"w":"penuhi","ipa":"/pəˈnuhi/","zh":"填满，满足（要求/承诺）","phrase":{"t":"memenuhi janji","zh":"履行承诺"},"example":{"t":"Dia selalu berusaha memenuhi janjinya.","zh":"他总是努力履行他的承诺。"}},{"w":"memenuhi","ipa":"/məˈnuhi/","zh":"使充满，符合（条件）","phrase":{"t":"memenuhi syarat","zh":"符合条件"},"example":{"t":"Kandidat itu memenuhi syarat untuk posisi tersebut.","zh":"该候选人符合那个职位的要求。"}},{"w":"sepenuhnya","ipa":"/səpənuhɲa/","zh":"完全地，彻底地","phrase":{"t":"percaya sepenuhnya","zh":"完全信任"},"example":{"t":"Saya setuju sepenuhnya dengan pendapat Anda.","zh":"我完全同意你的观点。"}},{"w":"kepenuhan","ipa":"/kəpənuhan/","zh":"充满状态，圆满","phrase":{"t":"kepenuhan hidup","zh":"生活的圆满"},"example":{"t":"Dia mencari kepenuhan dalam pekerjaannya.","zh":"他在工作中寻求圆满感。"}}],"derSlugs":["penuh","penuhi","memenuhi","sepenuhnya","kepenuhan"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-25T09:42:34.711Z","src":"base"}